<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Agent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The Agent class represents anything that has the potential to act on a system.\n\nThis could be a person, organization, software agent, etc.\n\nThis is not to be confused with tools that are used to perform tasks."@en .
