<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/duns> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Data Universal Numbering System (D-U-N-S) Number <https://www.dnb.com/en-us/smb/duns.html> is a unique nine-digit identifier, issued by Dun & Bradstreet, that identifies a business entity, often on a location-specific basis."@en .
